        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>NGP 8133-Kit-96, 7 x 3/8 x 96 Expansion Joint Threshold</b>\r\n<p>\r\n7\" wide x 3/8\" high x 96\" length aluminum ADA compliant expansion joint threshold.  These 96 inch long thresholds are made from non rusting T5 aluminum alloy and neoprene. They allow for unto 1\" floor gap.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nField sizable, non-handed, Anodized Aluminum finish.  Packaged with cement floor screws. Fluted anti-skid top. Ramped on both sides for easy access, ADA compliant. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for 8133-Kit-96 Threshold Assembly\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 96\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Thickness: .105 (3/32\")</li>\r\n<li>Material: T5 aluminum alloy & Neoprene</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Anodized Aluminum  </li>\r\n<li><b>ADA Compliant</b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/NGP-8133-cut-sheet.pdf?v=1704262439\" target=\"new\"><b>NGP 8133 Cutsheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
